x 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Oui, de sept heures à dix heures.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, from seven to ten.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Parfait. À quelle heure est le départ ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Perfect. What time is check-out?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>À midi. Voici votre clé, chambre vingt-deux.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">At noon. Here is your key, room twenty-two.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Merci beaucoup, bonne soirée !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Thank you very much, good evening!</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275975,"_nanoseconds":681000000}},{"id":"9MOGONmTudEKogXf7BCQ","level":"a1","lesson":12,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a1-l12-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Bonsoir ! Vous avez une réservation ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Good evening! Do you have a reservation?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Oui, au nom de Mensah. Ça s'écrit M, E, N, S, A, H.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, under Mensah. It's spelled M, E, N, S, A, H.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Oui, au nom de Mensah. Ça s'écrit M, E, N, S, A, H.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275975,"_nanoseconds":729000000}},{"id":"R2YR4WbeG0dT9nH7B5ht","level":"a1","lesson":12,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a1-l12-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transition